== runtime estimate ==
  243 contracts, Slither + a local 9B Qwen tag, 16 GB Apple Silicon.
  Token estimate from the Slither baseline triage prompt: ~2,644 input / ~1,204 output tokens per contract
  (p95 input ~8,205; a few contracts are much longer).
  A 9B Q4/Q5 model on a 16 GB M-series Mac is typically ~20–40 tok/s generate.
  That is roughly 45–90 seconds per contract (prefill + generation + Slither),
  so the full 243-contract sweep is about 3–6 hours wall clock.
  Budget 8 hours of headroom, and run it in tmux or screen so an SSH/GUI sleep does not kill it.
  Per-contract timeout default in this script: 300s (the slither-only default of 90s is too tight).
  Cost: $0. No paid API is called.

